> f(x: f32, y: f32) = ((abs(((-1.0f == (y / (0.5f + 1.0f))) ? asfloat(u32(0)) : asfloat(asuint(x))))) - 1.5f)
> g(x: f32, y: f32) = ((abs(((-1.0f == (y / 0.5f)) ? asfloat(u32(0)) : asfloat(asuint(x))))) - 1.5f)
> equiv f g
f and g are equal on the domain of f (sampled, not proved; no SAT proof: a float division (by other than a constant power of two))
> show f(1.0, -0.5)
_() = -0.5
  -> f32
> show g(1.0, -0.5)
_() = -1.5
  -> f32
